{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36356","headline":"题悬溜岩隐者居 · 方干","name":"题悬溜岩隐者居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世人如要问生涯，满架堆牀是五车。\n谷鸟暮蝉声四散，修篁灌木势交加。\n蒲葵细织团圆扇，薤叶平铺合遝花。\n却用水荷苞绿李，兼将寒井浸甘瓜。\n惯缘嶮峭收松粉，常趂芳鲜掇茗芽。\n池上树阴随浪动，窗前月影被巢遮。\n坐云独酌杯盘湿，穿竹微吟路径斜。\n见说公卿访遗逸，逢迎亦是戴乌纱。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36356.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36356","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}